          "newspaper / photo / minutes / old-book / incident-document handling rules where source-backed",
          "era-specific record-material differentiation",
          "paper / archive / digital-record material language",
          "call-name to surname clue to kanji/full-name reveal visual boundary",
          "missing / redacted / disputed record treatment",
          "provenance and correction-history treatment"
